      "widgets_values": [
        "<Picture 1> defines the exact courier identity and costume. <Picture 2> defines scene, composition and action direction. One continuous cinematic shot, warm grey soft film palette, burgundy matte coat, natural skin, stable exposure. Same short black bob woman, same face, clothing and body proportions throughout. Physically coherent motion, no extra limbs, no morphing, no cuts, no captions, no logo. Side tracking shot. The courier runs urgently left to right along the bridge, taking several grounded strides while protecting the single small golden seed with both hands against her chest. Her coat trails behind. The black ring searchlights sweep behind her, not across her face. Keep seed in her hands.",
